commit 0aa8b1424aa59dc302b19c793f1f87e83e89a35e

C03: minimizing an authenticated application by name, «minimisa» spelling (WINDOWS1695)

«Minimisa ópera.» (H0697) reached no operation: the window reader required the noun «ventana» and the request-head gate did not admit the s-for-z spelling. The mind now reads «minimizá X» / «minimize X» over one exact catalog identity (resolve_application_minimize_name, the same target resolution as focus and close by name; «ventana», «todo» and «everything» targets are excluded so the deictic and desktop readers keep theirs) as window.minimize, and window.resolve grounds applicationName from that target. The owner's Opera window is minimized by the product and restored by the root instrument after each case.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


